            "type": "paragraph",
            "content": {
                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "Tata Technologies Limited Employees Stock Option Plan 2001 (TTESOP Plan 2001) was launched by the Company in the year 2001. During the year under review, two option grantees, who were vested with 3,750 options in the previous financial year, exercised their options. The exercise price for these options was ` 645 per share. As on March 31, 2021, all the options that were granted to the employees under the scheme, have been exercised."
