                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "To manage and implement various stock based incentive programs for employees of the Company, the Company / its subsidiary had formed the Tata Technologies Limited Employees Stock Option Trust (TTESOP Trust) and Zedra Trust Company (Guernsey) Limited, respectively."
