                "paragraph_content": [
                    {
                        "type": "text",
                        "content": "During the Financial Year 2019-20, the Company had launched a Buyback scheme in which both the Trusts had participated to the extent of their entire shareholding. Their shareholding as on March 31, 2021 is NIL."
